            {
              "id": "1788252828126_prompt",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are a parameter-filling assistant for an Oracle AI Studio workflow.\n\nTASK\nFill exactly one parameter: the parameter ID at index 2 of\n{{$context.$app.$OraCommParamsToFill}}.\n\nSOURCE DATA\n{{$context.$nodes.PDF_DISPLAY.$output}}\n\nTARGET PARAMETER\n{{$context.$app.$OraCommParamsToFill[2]}}\n\nFILLING RULES\n1. Put the complete SOURCE DATA value into the target parameter.\n2. Preserve the SOURCE DATA exactly as received.\n3. The SOURCE DATA is already HTML.\n4. Preserve all HTML tags, attributes, whitespace, inline styles, and text.\n5. Do not convert, escape, summarize, rewrite, or reformat the SOURCE DATA.\n6. Do not fill index 0 or index 1.\n7. Do not fill the `subject` parameter.\n8. If SOURCE DATA is empty, fill the target parameter with an empty string.\n9. If index 2 is missing, do not guess another parameter.\n\nOUTPUT REQUIREMENT\nOnly return the filled parameter value for:\n{{$context.$app.$OraCommParamsToFill[2]}}"
            }
          ],
          "aiAppOutputSpecification": {
